{"kind": "mod", "id": 2737, "name": "Spy's JSOC-SWR", "slug": "spys-jsoc-swr", "teaser": "Modern military carbines and precision rifles inspired by today's most exclusive Special Operations contracts.", "owner_name": "spysbrother", "downloads": 10851, "favourites": 48, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.spy.jsoc-swr", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Weapons", "category_id": 13, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:57:28.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-12T02:03:48.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-11T22:00:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "2.0.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>Spy’s JSOC-SWR</h1>\n<p>Huge thanks to bobinstein for the full refactor, Unity and Blender work, shader help, bundle work, audio fixes, and for helping get this update across the finish line.</p>\n<p>Spy’s JSOC-SWR, short for Joint Special Operations Command Service Weapon Replacement, is the 2.0.0 refactor and expansion of Spy’s KAC KS-1.</p>\n<p>This mod brings the Knight’s Armament KS-1, SOLGW MK1, GFR, GFR-X, LMT platform, and 6mm ARC ammunition into SPT with custom parts, presets, bundles, shaders, and Peacekeeper availability.</p>\n<p>The KS-1 includes black and FDE variants with matching KAC components. The SOLGW MK1 includes Black, FDE, Camo, and Grey variants. JSOC-SWR also adds GFR/GFR-X content, LMT weapon content, multiple barrel and handguard options, custom receiver parts, gas blocks, charging handles, furniture, and ready-to-run trader presets.</p>\n<p>If you wanted a slick modern AR-style rifle platform that feels right at home alongside Tarkov’s existing weapon ecosystem, this one should scratch that itch.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Black and FDE KS-1 rifle variants</li>\n<li>SOLGW MK1 variants in Black, FDE, Camo, and Grey</li>\n<li>GFR and GFR-X weapon content</li>\n<li>LMT weapon content</li>\n<li>6mm ARC ammunition support</li>\n<li>Custom KAC, SOLGW, GFR, and LMT parts</li>\n<li>Multiple barrel and handguard options</li>\n<li>Peacekeeper assort and presets</li>\n<li>Custom bundles and shader setup</li>\n<li>Server-side only</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Delete the old <code>spys-kac-ks1</code> folder if you have it installed.</li>\n<li>Download and extract the mod archive.</li>\n<li>Place the <code>spys-JSOC-SWR</code> folder into your SPT <code>user/mods</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Launch SPT and enjoy.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Do not run <code>spys-kac-ks1</code> and <code>spys-JSOC-SWR</code> at the same time.</p>\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.13</li>\n<li>WTT-ServerCommonLib 2.0.20</li>\n<li>EpicsAIO 4.0.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>Huge thanks to bobinstein for the full refactor, Unity and Blender work, shader help, bundle work, audio fixes, and for helping get this update across the finish line.</p>\n<p>Additional thanks to EpicRangeTime for shaders and EpicsAIO.</p>\n<h2>Media</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpyPilotEFT/Spys-JSOC-SWR/v2.0.1/media/noveske-gen1-300blk-build.png\" alt=\"Noveske Gen 1 .300 Blackout build\" />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Os6GqTYwVpc\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Os6GqTYwVpc</a></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"tExwL5P4U1I\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/tExwL5P4U1I?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tExwL5P4U1I/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpyPilotEFT/Spys-JSOC-SWR/main/media/jsoc-swr-wall-showcase.png\" alt=\"JSOC-SWR wall showcase\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpyPilotEFT/Spys-JSOC-SWR/main/media/gfr-mod1-6arc-fde-inspect.png\" alt=\"Geissele Freedom Rifle MOD1 6mm ARC FDE inspect\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpyPilotEFT/Spys-JSOC-SWR/main/media/solgw-mk1-camo-inspect.png\" alt=\"SOLGW MK1 camo inspect\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpyPilotEFT/Spys-JSOC-SWR/main/media/ks1-fde-inspect.png\" alt=\"KAC KS-1 FDE inspect\" /></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.13", "content_length": 127494460, "downloads": 649, "published_at": "2026-06-11T22:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2737/spys-jsoc-swr/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.13", "content_length": 101951205, "downloads": 182, "published_at": "2026-06-12T14:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2737/spys-jsoc-swr/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.13", "content_length": 100009131, "downloads": 748, "published_at": "2026-06-12T19:00:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2737/spys-jsoc-swr/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.13", "content_length": 101951574, "downloads": 792, "published_at": "2026-06-13T22:30:00.000000Z", "forge_l